  "markup": "\u003Ch2 data-start=\u0022133\u0022 data-end=\u0022152\u0022\u003EMonitor Symptoms\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022154\u0022 data-end=\u0022215\u0022\u003ETrack weight, swelling, breathing changes, and fatigue daily.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2 data-start=\u0022217\u0022 data-end=\u0022249\u0022\u003ETake Medications Consistently\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022251\u0022 data-end=\u0022326\u0022\u003EFollow prescriptions carefully to reduce complications and hospital visits.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2 data-start=\u0022328\u0022 data-end=\u0022351\u0022\u003EReduce Sodium Intake\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022353\u0022 data-end=\u0022407\u0022\u003ELimit processed foods to help prevent fluid retention.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2 data-start=\u0022409\u0022 data-end=\u0022434\u0022\u003EStay Physically Active\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022436\u0022 data-end=\u0022502\u0022\u003ELight exercise can improve circulation and overall heart function.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2 data-start=\u0022504\u0022 data-end=\u0022530\u0022\u003EAttend Regular Checkups\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022532\u0022 data-end=\u0022589\u0022 data-is-last-node=\u0022\u0022 data-is-only-node=\u0022\u0022\u003ERoutine monitoring helps detect worsening symptoms early.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
